  "[SYSTEM DIRECTIVE: OH-MY-OPENCODE",
  "[Category+Skill Reminder]",
  "[EDIT ERROR - IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED]",
  "[task CALL FAILED - IMMEDIATE RETRY REQUIRED]",
